"The 10‑pin 1.27 mm ARM Cortex Debug header on the breakout is wired straight"
" to the AE3's SWD/JTAG lines. All signals are **1.8 V referenced** — use a "
"level‑shifting probe or one whose target voltage tracks ``VCC_REF`` (pin 1)."
